OL,3,GNEWSASwinney visits 'crisis' towns
OL,4,Aasking for help after 1,500 job losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwinney met local politicians and a
OL,7,Fcommunity group as well as visiting the
OL,8,Fnationalised Ferguson shipyard, a week
OL,9,Fafter the firm announced plans to shed
OL,10,Fa quarter of its workforce.
